  duties: ["Assign loads and routes to drivers", "Plan schedules within hours-of-service limits", "Book pickup and delivery appointments", "Track shipments with GPS and ELD data", "Update customers on status and delays", "Solve breakdowns, detention and weather problems", "Keep records in the transportation management system"],
